<title>ZAMBIA: ZCCM copper, cobalt production up in September.</title>
<headline>ZCCM copper, cobalt production up in September.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zambia Consolidated Copper Mines (ZCCM) copper and cobalt production increased by 21 and 3.4 percent respectively in September from August, central bank figures obtained on Thursday showed.</p>
<p>Copper production in September was 30,346 tonnes from 25,141 in August, with exports increasing to 30,483 tonnes from 29,046 tonnes.</p>
<p>Cobalt production increased to 456 tonnes from 441 tonnes in August. September cobalt exports were 499 tonnes from 211 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Lusaka office, +260 1 222689</p>
</text>
